     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_ktav_tachat_hatzura",
     "gloss_en": "the baraita: writing running under a picture or under images may not be read on Shabbat"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.149a.3",
   "sugya": "shabbat_149a_mone_min_haktav",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_kotel_midalei",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ולמאן דאמר שמא ימחוק ניחוש שמא יקרא! ותו, לשמא ימחוק לא חיישינן? והתניא לא יקרא לאור הנר, ואמר רבה: אפילו גבוה שתי קומות... לא יקרא",
     "against": "p_nm_kotel_midalei",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lo_yikra_leor_hanner",
     "gloss_en": "the baraita: one may not read by the light of a lamp"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.149a.5",
   "sugya": "shabbat_149a_mone_min_haktav",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_kotel_mitatei",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ולמאן דאמר שמא יקרא, ליחוש שמא ימחוק!",
     "against": "p_nm_kotel_mitatei",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_nm_chakuk",
     "gloss_en": "rather, the difference: engraved on a tablet or board -- on 'lest he erase' we are not concerned, on 'lest he read' we are"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.149a.6",
   "sugya": "shabbat_149a_mone_min_haktav",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_chakuk",
     "kind": "tanya",
     "gloss_en": "ולמאן דאמר שמא ימחוק ליחוש שמא יקרא! וכי תימא טבלא ופינקס בשטרא לא מיחלף -- והתניא: ...מכתב שעל גבי הכותל אבל לא מכתב שעל גבי טבלא ופינקס; and the baraita speaks of engraved writing (149a.7)",
     "against": "p_nm_chakuk",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_mone_mikitav_kotel",
     "gloss_en": "the baraita: one may count how many inside, how many outside, and how many portions he will set before them, from writing on the wall"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Shabbat.149a.11",
   "sugya": "shabbat_149a_mone_min_haktav",
